A simple diagram of the [[water-cycle|water cycle]]. Water evaporates from the ocean, condenses into clouds, falls as rain over the land, returns through plants by transpiration, and flows back to the sea as runoff. Drawn as a vector image, so it stays sharp at any size and can be edited freely.
